[Term]
id: PROMOT:0032013
name: Difficulty changing basic position
def: "A difficulty to change basic position, i.e. a difficulty getting into and out of a body position and moving from one location to another, such as getting up out of a chair to lie down on a bed, and getting into and out of positions of sitting, standing, kneeling or squatting. This is distinct from the difficulty of transferring oneself." [] {IAO:0000119="ICF:150502901"}
is_a: HP:0100022
is_a: PROMOT:0032003 ! Activity related phenotype
relationship: PROMOT:2000001 ICF:150502901 ! affecte
property_value: IAO:0000117 "https://orcid.org/0009-0000-5160-7927" xsd:string
property_value: PROMOT:1000001 "[OPMD Scoping review 2026] Bélair N, Gagnon C, Duchesne E. What is known about muscle weakness, balance impairments and indoor mobility limitations in oculopharyngeal muscular dystrophy? A scoping review. J Neuromuscul Dis. 2025 Dec 30:22143602251397052. doi: 10.1177/22143602251397052. Epub ahead of print. PMID: 41467981." xsd:string

[Term]
id: PROMOT:0032014
name: Difficulty walking short distance
def: "A difficulty to walk for less than a kilometre, such as walking around rooms or hallways, within a building or for short distances outside. This is distinct from the difficulty of moving around." [] {IAO:0000119="ICF:555410497"}
is_a: HP:0001288
relationship: PROMOT:2000001 ICF:555410497 ! affecte
property_value: IAO:0000117 "https://orcid.org/0009-0000-5160-7927" xsd:string
