def: "A type of weakness of the ocular muscles that occurs after a muscle group is used and lessens if the muscle group has some rest. That is, there is diminution of the strength of the ocular muscles with repetitive muscle actions." [] {comment="[PROMOT project] Mansoore Gholizade (definition reviewer)", IAO:0000119="HP:0003473"}
